    "ev-cf2f8c523735"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "unknowns": [
  "No traces are in the snapshot, so it is unknown which service's own self time accounts for the latency versus time spent waiting on downstream calls.",
  "No pre-deploy baseline or latency time series is available. Onset detection returned null, so it is unclear whether latency rose after 10:03:21Z or was already elevated.",
  "No logs from inventory are available to show slow queries, retries or other new behaviour in 3.2.4.",
  "The call graph (gateway -> orders -> inventory) is assumed, not shown in the evidence.",
  "Downstream dependencies of inventory (database, cache) were not covered by any evidence."
 ],
 "recommended_actions": [
  {
   "action": "Compare inventory p95 latency before and after 10:03:21Z, using a wider window that includes time before the deploy.",
   "rationale": "This would establish whether the slowdown starts at the deploy, which is the key missing link.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-3723edf2d58b",
    "ev-cf2f8c523735"
   ]
  },
  {
   "action": "Pull Jaeger traces for checkout requests and check self time per span, especially inventory spans.",
